  rng_aimg RNG -> rng RNG lo (top - lo) -> rng RNG ctx 4096 -> rng RNG t 4096 ->
  evtF bsegs RNG (unwind_impl_post S pc bp t ra sp gp tp s0 s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 F fc lo tr m)
